OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect also investigated
OL,4,Aover five burglaries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder while already being investigated
OL,8,Fover five aggravated burglaries,
OL,9,FGreater Manchester Police has said.
OL,11,FA man in his 70s was found dead during
OL,12,Fa search of an address on Whitstable
OL,13,FClose, in Chadderton, Oldham.
OL,15,FHe is believed to have died between 4
OL,16,Fand 7 November, with his death being
OL,17,Ftreated as suspicious. His loved ones
OL,18,Fhave been informed.
